# Shadhil CRM — Client Questions to Resolve Before Implementation

**Source:** Consolidated from 7 rounds of client feedback (2026-08-29).
**Status:** Send to Shadhil sales leadership. Each answer unblocks a
design decision in `DESIGN.md`. PaalStack cannot start building until
at least Q0, Q1, and Q4 are answered.

---

## Must-have (block start)

- **Q0 (blocker).** Is the WhatsApp Business number for the CRM
  the SAME one currently used on the landing site (+91 9025012311),
  or do you have a separate production-approved number we should
  use? If same — what's the status of Meta template approval and
  WABA assignment? (As of Aug 27: the existing setup is on the Meta
  test number, the app dashboard has no WhatsApp product yet, the
  WABA is not assigned to the system user, and templates are not
  approved for production.)

- **Q1.** How many concurrent telecallers, sales executives, and
  managers will use the CRM daily? (Affects concurrency model,
  notification design, Coolify VPS sizing.)

- **Q4.** Expected leads per month from shadhilbuilders.in and
  any other channels (99acres, MagicBricks, walk-ins, broker
  network)? (Drives load assumptions and ingestion design.)

---

## High-value (answer before MVP ships)

- **Q2.** What is the booking-to-agreement document flow today —
  manual, lawyer-mediated, or RERA-mandated template? (Drives
  whether Document Vault ships in v1 or v2 and whether we need
  agreement template generation in MVP.)

- **Q3.** RERA / Tamil Nadu real-estate compliance requirements
  for lead handling and audit trail? (Affects audit log fields,
  data-retention rules, consent capture.)

- **Q5.** Mobile-first vs desktop-first usage? Field agents are
  on phones — is mobile responsive enough or do we need PWA in
  v1? (We recommend PWA first, then Expo app in v1.1.)

- **Q8.** Sales targets / KPIs the manager must see on a dashboard
  — bookings/month per agent, revenue pipeline, lead-to-visit
  conversion by source? (Drives the single funnel widget shipped
  in v1.)

- **Q9.** Manager account creation: who does it? Admin user in
  this app, or seeded out-of-band by Shadhil leadership?
  Recommendation: admin creates them too, but the first manager
  is seeded by you.

- **Q11.** For the "no personal phone" rule on voice calls: do
  you want call recording on the cloud telephony (FreJun supports
  it), or just call logging? Recording is helpful for manager
  oversight but adds compliance overhead.

- **Q12.** Audit log retention period? RERA typically requires
  5-7 years for transaction records. Confirm.

- **Q13.** "Manager sees all conversations" — across ALL managers,
  or only within their team? My matrix assumes "their reports
  only." Confirm.

- **Q15.** "Once customer agrees to visit" — is this a one-click
  handoff button the telecaller clicks, or does the manager
  confirm the customer's intent? My model assumes one-click
  handoff from telecaller.

